close_reason: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/pull/231 (merged); changelog entries can use resolution prose and warn on defect-shaped titles"
body: "Likely shape: an --entry-from <field> flag accepting close_reason first, since a closed issue already states its resolution there and the pm CLI records it as part of the close transition. Items without the field fall back to title so no existing repo changes behaviour."
